SUMMARY:Chico Bean LIVE at Pittsburgh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Chico Bean\nChico Bean is one of the most electrifying comedians in the game today\, best known as a fan favorite on Nick Cannon’s Wild ‘N Out on MTV. \nBorn in Washington D.C.\, Chico Bean has been performing stand-up since his teens and has built a massive following through his sharp wit\, freestyle rap battles\, and hilarious crowd work. His energy on stage is unmatched — every show is a unique\, high-octane experience. \nBeyond Wild ‘N Out\, Chico Bean has toured extensively across the country and released stand-up content that has racked up millions of views online. He is one of the most in-demand live comedy performers working today. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, PA 15120\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAbout the Venue\nThe Pittsburgh Improv is Pittsburgh’s premier comedy club\, located in the Waterfront entertainment complex in Homestead\, PA — just minutes from downtown Pittsburgh. \nThe intimate showroom seats approximately 300 guests with excellent sightlines from every seat. A full-service bar and restaurant are on-site\, with a two-drink minimum per person. \nFree parking is available throughout the Waterfront complex. Easily accessible via I-376 and Route 837. Arrive early to enjoy dinner before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nChico Bean’s live show is a non-stop comedy experience — expect rapid-fire jokes\, crowd interaction\, freestyle moments\, and a performance that keeps you on the edge of your seat. \nHis ability to connect with audiences and turn any moment into comedy gold is what sets him apart. This is a must-see show for fans of Wild ‘N Out and anyone who loves high-energy stand-up. \nThe Pittsburgh Improv typically features a local opener before the headliner takes the stage. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $25 – $60 depending on seating and availability. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chico-bean-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, Pennsylvania\, 15120\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/57e/60329c24-258f-4416-b46a-c85171c7d57e_1462461_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg
GEO:40.4089383;-79.9149412
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pittsburgh Improv 166 E. Bridge St Homestead Pennsylvania 15120 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=166 E. Bridge St:geo:-79.9149412,40.4089383
END:VEVENT
