SUMMARY:Killers of Kill Tony LIVE at Linda Ronstadt Music Hall
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Killers of Kill Tony\nKillers of Kill Tony is the live touring spinoff of the massively popular Kill Tony podcast\, hosted by Tony Hinchcliffe. The show features a rotating lineup of the podcast’s most beloved and breakout comedians performing full stand-up sets. \nKnown for launching the careers of numerous rising stars\, Kill Tony has become one of the most influential platforms in comedy. The Killers tour brings the best of that world to theaters and music halls across the country. \nThis Tucson edition features David Lucas\, Timmy No Brakes\, Martin Phillips\, and Dedrick Flynn — a stacked lineup of some of the funniest comedians in the game right now. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Linda Ronstadt Music Hall\, 260 South Church Avenue\, Tucson\, AZ 85701\nSeating: Reserved Seating\nTicket Prices: Starting from $57+\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Linda Ronstadt Music Hall is one of Tucson’s premier entertainment venues\, located in the heart of downtown at the Tucson Convention Center complex. \nNamed in honor of Tucson’s own legendary singer Linda Ronstadt\, the hall seats approximately 2\,300 guests and offers excellent sightlines from virtually every seat in the house. \nThe venue features a warm\, intimate atmosphere with comfortable seating\, great acoustics\, and a full-service bar. Parking is available in the adjacent Convention Center garage and nearby surface lots. \nWhat to Expect\nThe Killers of Kill Tony show is a high-energy\, multi-comedian stand-up event that showcases some of the most exciting voices in comedy today. \nFans of the Kill Tony podcast will love seeing their favorite comedians perform full sets in a proper theater setting. Newcomers will discover why this show has become one of the hottest tickets in comedy. Expect big laughs\, great energy\, and a night to remember. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $57+ and are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/killers-of-kill-tony-at-linda-ronstadt-music-hall/
LOCATION:Linda Ronstadt Music Hall\, 260 South Church Avenue\, Tucson\, AZ\, 85701\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/3cf/65745505-7029-4d14-9a24-9c55dd6103cf_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg
GEO:32.2177924;-110.9737622
