SUMMARY:James Austin Johnson LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJames Austin Johnson LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\nOne of the most buzzed-about comedians in the country\, James Austin Johnson brings his extraordinary impressions and stand-up comedy to Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco. Best known for his uncanny portrayals of Donald Trump and other public figures on Saturday Night Live\, JAJ delivers a live show that is equal parts hilarious and jaw-dropping. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2-item minimum per person \nAbout James Austin Johnson\nJames Austin Johnson is a comedian and impressionist best known as a cast member on Saturday Night Live\, where he became famous for his spot-on impression of Donald Trump. Beyond his SNL fame\, JAJ is a gifted stand-up comedian with a unique voice and a talent for character work that sets him apart from his peers. His live shows are a must-see for comedy fans. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class impressions and stand-up comedy from an SNL fan favorite\nHilarious character work and original material\nAn intimate club atmosphere at one of SF’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar and food service available throughout the show\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for the best spots\nA night of non-stop laughs you won’t soon forget\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s most beloved comedy venues\, located in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood at 915 Columbus Avenue. With a capacity of around 400\, it offers an intimate yet energetic atmosphere perfect for live stand-up comedy\, with full bar and food service available. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). Prices vary based on availability. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges unless the event is cancelled. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/james-austin-johnson-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/992ae7ae-1a9e-4ca3-af4e-0fe6474eea44_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9-DyYYa1.jpg
GEO:37.8029543;-122.4143041
