SUMMARY:Liz Miele LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLiz Miele is a New York-based stand-up comedian\, writer\, and podcaster known for her sharp wit\, self-deprecating humor\, and fearlessly honest storytelling. \nWith multiple comedy specials under her belt and years of touring experience\, Miele has built a devoted following for her relatable\, intelligent\, and laugh-out-loud funny material. Her comedy covers everything from relationships and anxiety to pop culture and everyday absurdities. \nShe is also the host of the popular podcast Hysterical\, where she explores comedy and mental health. Liz Miele is a rising force in stand-up and this San Francisco run is not to be missed. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Doors open approximately 1 hour prior)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club — 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 drinks per person required\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco is one of the most iconic comedy clubs on the West Coast\, located at 444 Battery Street in the Financial District. \nFounded in 1978\, the Punch Line has launched the careers of countless comedy legends and continues to be a premier destination for stand-up comedy in the Bay Area. The intimate room seats approximately 300 guests and offers an up-close\, personal experience with the performers. \nThe venue features a full bar\, table seating\, and a two-drink minimum per person. Parking is available in nearby lots and on the street. The Punch Line is easily accessible by BART and Muni\, making it a convenient night out in the heart of San Francisco. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect an evening of sharp\, witty\, and deeply relatable stand-up comedy from one of the most talented voices in the game today. \nLiz Miele’s live shows are known for their warmth\, intelligence\, and genuine connection with the audience. She brings a conversational style that makes every show feel personal and spontaneous. \nThe show runs approximately 75 minutes. Arrive early to grab a drink and get a great seat in this intimate venue. Multiple shows are available throughout the weekend\, so check the schedule for the time that works best for you. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from approximately $25 – $48 (before fees). \nSecure your seats now before they sell out: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/liz-miele-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-san-francisco/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, California\, 94111\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/bfc/0b32ee06-afbc-4926-bdc0-5430e7cb2bfc_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
