SUMMARY:Jimmy Carr: Laughs Funny LIVE at Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nJimmy Carr is one of the most distinctive and fearless comedians in the world — a British stand-up legend known for his razor-sharp wit\, lightning-fast delivery\, and his willingness to go places other comedians simply won’t. With a career spanning over two decades\, Jimmy has become one of the most successful touring comedians on the planet\, selling out arenas across the UK\, Europe\, and North America. \nKnown for his dark\, intelligent humor and his mastery of the one-liner format\, Jimmy Carr’s Laughs Funny tour is his latest all-new stand-up show — packed with the kind of sharp\, provocative comedy that has made him a global phenomenon. His Netflix specials\, including His Dark Material and Terribly Funny\, have introduced his comedy to millions of new fans worldwide. \nDue to overwhelming demand\, Jimmy has added a second night at the Encore Theater — July 10 and 11 — making this a rare two-night Las Vegas engagement from one of comedy’s biggest international stars. \nEvent Details\n\nDates: Friday\, July 10 & Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\nAddress: 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas is one of the most intimate and prestigious entertainment venues on the Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the luxurious Wynn Las Vegas resort at 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, the Encore Theater seats approximately 1\,600 guests and is celebrated for its exceptional acoustics\, elegant design\, and the up-close\, personal atmosphere it creates for every performance. \nThe Encore Theater has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and entertainment\, including Sebastian Maniscalco\, Jerry Seinfeld\, and now Jimmy Carr. Its intimate layout ensures that every seat feels close to the stage\, making it one of the best venues in Las Vegas for a stand-up comedy show. \nValet and self-parking are available at Wynn Las Vegas. The resort offers world-class dining\, shopping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a Jimmy Carr show into a full luxury Las Vegas evening. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Jimmy Carr featuring all-new material from his Laughs Funny tour. The show runs approximately 90 minutes and features Jimmy’s signature rapid-fire delivery\, dark wit\, and the kind of fearless\, boundary-pushing comedy that has made him one of the most talked-about comedians in the world. \nJimmy Carr’s live shows are known for their electric atmosphere and the sense that anything could happen — his comedy is sharp\, surprising\, and relentlessly funny. Whether you’re a longtime fan or seeing him for the first time\, this is a show that will leave you breathless with laughter. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $90 – $500+ \nTickets available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Both nights are expected to sell out — grab your seats now! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jimmy-carr-laughs-funny-encore-theater-wynn-las-vegas-july/
LOCATION:Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\, 3131 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/0b1/497bd6bf-7554-45bd-bc26-7da9f41150b1_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
