DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nSeth Meyers LIVE at Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nLate Night with Seth Meyers host and comedy legend Seth Meyers brings his acclaimed stand-up show to the Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, CT on July 10\, 2026. Known for his sharp wit\, political commentary\, and brilliant storytelling\, Meyers delivers a night of sophisticated comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nAddress: 39 Norwich Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT 06339\nAge Requirement: 18 & Over\nTicket Prices: Starting at $94 \nAbout Seth Meyers\nSeth Meyers is the host of Late Night with Seth Meyers on NBC\, a role he has held since 2014. Before that\, he was a cast member and head writer on Saturday Night Live for over a decade. Known for his sharp political humor and “A Closer Look” segments\, Meyers is one of the most respected voices in comedy today. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSophisticated stand-up comedy performance\nSharp political and observational humor\nBrilliant storytelling and wit\n18+ event at a premier casino resort venue\nOne of late night television’s biggest stars live on stage\nAn unforgettable evening of laughs at Foxwoods\n\nVenue Information\nThe Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino is a world-class entertainment venue located at 39 Norwich Westerly Road in Mashantucket\, CT. The theater offers premium seating\, excellent sightlines\, and all the amenities of the renowned Foxwoods Resort Casino complex. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $94 and are available now. This is an 18+ event. All ticket sales are final and non-refundable. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
