DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets Here \nGabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias LIVE at Hard Rock Live\nGabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias\, one of America’s most beloved comedians\, brings his signature storytelling and family-friendly humor to South Florida. Known for his hilarious sound effects\, animated storytelling\, and relatable observations about family life\, Iglesias has become a household name through his Netflix specials and sold-out arena tours. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Hard Rock Live\nAddress: 1 Seminole Way\, Hollywood\, FL 33314\nCapacity: 7\,000 seats\nParking: Available on-site\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \nAbout Gabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias\nGabriel Iglesias is a world-renowned comedian known for his animated storytelling\, hilarious sound effects\, and family-friendly humor. With multiple Netflix specials and sold-out arena shows worldwide\, Fluffy has become one of the most recognizable voices in comedy today. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious storytelling with Gabriel’s signature animated style\nFamily-friendly comedy perfect for all ages\nSound effects and impressions that bring stories to life\nRelatable observations about family\, food\, and everyday life\nInteractive moments with the audience\nAn unforgettable evening with one of comedy’s biggest stars\n\nVenue Information\nHard Rock Live is a premier entertainment venue offering excellent sightlines and acoustics\, located within the Seminole Hard Rock Hotel & Casino complex with dining and entertainment options. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through Ticketmaster with various seating options and price ranges available for this highly anticipated show. \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets Here \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
