SUMMARY:Jetpack Comedy: Big Comics\, Small Venue LIVE at Bar Lubitsch
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nJetpack Comedy: Big Comics\, Small Venue is one of Los Angeles’ most celebrated weekly stand-up showcases\, featured in The New York Times and LA Weekly as one of the country’s premiere standup showcases. \nEvery Friday night\, Jetpack brings together comics from HBO\, Netflix\, and SNL — plus big surprise drop-ins — all in an intimate venue setting. No overpriced bad food\, no drink minimum\, just killer comedy. \nEvent Details\nVenue: Bar Lubitsch\, 7702 Santa Monica Boulevard\, West Hollywood\, CA 90046 \nDate: Every Friday night \nDoors Open: 8:00 PM | Show Starts: 8:30 PM \nDuration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAge Requirement: 21+ \nAccessibility: The venue is wheelchair accessible. \nAbout the Venue\nBar Lubitsch is an intimate bar and event space located at 7702 Santa Monica Boulevard in West Hollywood\, California. The cozy setting makes it the perfect backdrop for an up-close comedy experience. \nThe small venue format is part of what makes Jetpack Comedy special — audiences get to experience world-class comedians in a setting that feels personal and electric. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a high-energy night of stand-up comedy featuring nationally recognized headliners and surprise guests. Jetpack Comedy has been running for over ten years and consistently delivers top-tier performances. \nThe intimate atmosphere means you’re never far from the action. Come ready to laugh — and maybe spot your favorite comedian from TV or streaming. \nTicket Information\nGeneral Admission tickets are $20.00. No booking fees apply. Tickets are available through Fever. \nGet Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jetpack-comedy-big-comics-small-venue-live-at-bar-lubitsch/
