SUMMARY:DeRay Davis: Live in Las Vegas at Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nDeRay Davis is one of the most electrifying stand-up comedians working today — a Chicago-born powerhouse whose high-energy performances\, sharp storytelling\, and magnetic stage presence have made him a fan favorite across the country. Known for his roles in films like 21 Jump Street\, Barbershop\, and How High\, DeRay has built a reputation as both a gifted actor and a fearless stand-up comedian. \nHis comedy is raw\, real\, and relentlessly funny — drawing from his own life experiences growing up in Chicago\, navigating Hollywood\, and finding humor in the everyday chaos of modern life. DeRay Davis brings an infectious energy to every performance that leaves audiences laughing from the moment he hits the stage. \nThis one-night-only show at the Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort is a rare chance to see DeRay Davis live in Las Vegas — don’t miss it. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 10:00 PM\nVenue: Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort\nAddress: 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nNote: One night only\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort is one of Las Vegas’s premier entertainment venues\, located inside the iconic Venetian Resort at 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd. The theater seats approximately 1\,800 guests and is renowned for its intimate atmosphere\, excellent sightlines\, and world-class production capabilities. \nThe Palazzo Theatre has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy\, including Brian Regan\, Mark Normand\, Iliza Shlesinger\, and many more. Its mid-size format makes it the perfect venue for a high-energy comedy show — close enough to feel the performer’s energy\, large enough to create an electric crowd atmosphere. \nValet and self-parking are available at The Venetian Resort. The resort offers world-class dining\, shopping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a DeRay Davis show into a full Las Vegas night out. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by DeRay Davis — one night only at the Palazzo Theatre. Expect a high-energy\, no-holds-barred comedy show packed with hilarious stories\, sharp observations\, and the kind of raw\, authentic humor that has made DeRay Davis one of the most exciting comedians on the circuit today. \nDeRay Davis’s live shows are known for their incredible energy and the deep connection he builds with his audience. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering him for the first time\, this is a show you won’t want to miss. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $150 \nTickets go on sale March 13\, 2026. Available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/deray-davis-live-palazzo-theatre-venetian-las-vegas-july/
LOCATION:Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort\, 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/332/b7e2b245-267c-402a-a78f-c50f46a63332_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
