SUMMARY:DC Young Fly LIVE at Goodyear Theater
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nDC Young Fly LIVE at Goodyear Theater\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughs as DC Young Fly takes the stage at the iconic Goodyear Theater in Akron\, Ohio! Known for his explosive energy\, hilarious storytelling\, and viral social media presence\, DC Young Fly delivers a stand-up experience you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Goodyear Theater\nAddress: 1201 East Market Street\, Akron\, OH 44305\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event\nParking: Available at nearby lots and parking decks \nAbout DC Young Fly\nDC Young Fly (John Whitfield) is an Atlanta-born comedian\, actor\, and social media sensation who rose to fame through hilarious Vine and Instagram videos. He is best known for his appearances on MTV’s Wild ‘N Out and has starred in films including Almost Christmas and How High 2. His raw\, energetic stand-up style has earned him a massive following and sold-out shows across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from one of social media’s biggest stars\nHilarious storytelling rooted in real-life experiences\nCrowd interaction and improvised moments\nA night of non-stop laughter in an intimate theater setting\nAn unforgettable live performance from a fan-favorite comedian\n\nVenue Information\nThe Goodyear Theater is a beloved entertainment venue located at 1201 East Market Street in Akron\, Ohio. With a capacity that creates an intimate atmosphere\, the theater offers excellent sightlines and a vibrant setting for live comedy and entertainment events. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $94. This is an 18+ event — valid photo ID required for entry. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale marketplace). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dc-young-fly-live-at-goodyear-theater/
LOCATION:Goodyear Theater\, 1201 E Market St\, Akron\, OH\, 44305\, USA
