DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nTERRY FATOR: Pure Imagination LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAmerica’s Got Talent winner Terry Fator brings his spectacular Pure Imagination show to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino. Combining ventriloquism\, singing\, comedy\, and impressions\, Fator delivers a one-of-a-kind entertainment experience that has captivated audiences worldwide. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAddress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON L2G 3Y5 \nAbout Terry Fator\nTerry Fator is the winner of America’s Got Talent Season 2 and one of the most successful entertainers in Las Vegas history. His unique blend of ventriloquism\, singing\, comedy\, and celebrity impressions has earned him a massive following and a long-running Las Vegas residency. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class ventriloquism and celebrity impressions\nHilarious comedy and musical performances\nA spectacular one-of-a-kind entertainment experience\nA world-class venue at Fallsview Casino\nAn unforgettable night of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nThe OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino is a premier entertainment venue at 6366 Stanley Ave in Niagara Falls\, Ontario. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $75. Get your seats now! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
